					<Placemark id="0F51B6545D2EAEF59831">
						<name>Lech’ous (Les Coux)</name>
						<description><![CDATA[<table class="infobox_v2 noarchive" style="font-size: 12.6px; background: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.2em; clear: right; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em 1em; width: 294px; border: 1px solid rgb(170, 170, 170); border-spacing: 5px; font-family: sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><tbody><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altitude" title="Altitude" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Altitude</a><br></th><td>1&nbsp;531&nbsp;<abbr class="abbr" title="mètre" style="border-bottom: 0px; cursor: help; text-decoration: none;">m<br></abbr><br></td></tr></tbody></table><div><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px">Il s'agit d'un<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volcan" title="Volcan" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal;">volcan</a><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89ruption_p%C3%A9l%C3%A9enne" title="Éruption péléenne" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal;">péléen</a><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px"><span>&nbsp;</span>en forme de croissant de lune</span></span></span><sup id="cite_ref-:0_2-1" class="reference" style="line-height: 1; vertical-align: text-top; position: relative; font-size: 0.8em; top: -5px; padding-left: 1px; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Les_Coux#cite_note-:0-2" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">2</a></sup><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px">. Sur son versant oriental se trouve la «&nbsp;table du diable&nbsp;», une dalle élevée sur deux points d’appui qui surmonte un autre monolithe enterré. Ses dimensions sont de 5&nbsp;mètres de long, 60&nbsp;centimètres d’épaisseur pour un poids estimé de 8&nbsp;tonnes</span></span></span><sup id="cite_ref-4" class="reference" style="line-height: 1; vertical-align: text-top; position: relative; font-size: 0.8em; top: -5px; padding-left: 1px; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Les_Coux#cite_note-4" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">4</a></sup><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px">.</span></span></span><br></div>]]></description>
