								<name>volcan d&apos;Ossau (Pic du Midi d&apos;Ossau)</name>
								<description><![CDATA[<div>altitude : 2884m<br></div><div>Âge : 290 millions d'années<br></div><div>Dernière éruption :&nbsp;250 millions d'années<br></div><div>Type :&nbsp;Volcan de rift<br></div><div><br></div><div><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px">Le<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><b style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">volcan d'Ossau</b><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px"><span>&nbsp;</span>est un<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volcan" title="Volcan" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal;">volcan</a><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px"><span>&nbsp;</span>éteint situé sur la chaîne actuelle des<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pyr%C3%A9n%C3%A9es" title="Pyrénées" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal;">Pyrénées</a><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px">, apparu il y a<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span class="nowrap" style="white-space: nowrap; color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px">290 millions</span></span></span><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px"><span>&nbsp;</span>d'années et éteint depuis<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span class="nowrap" style="white-space: nowrap; color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px">250 millions</span></span></span><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px"><span>&nbsp;</span>d'années. L'effondrement de son toit provoque la formation d'une<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caldeira" title="Caldeira" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal;">caldeira</a><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px"><span>&nbsp;</span>dont provient le<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pic_du_Midi_d%27Ossau" title="Pic du Midi d'Ossau" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-inden