								<description><![CDATA[<div>Dernière éruption :&nbsp;il y a 750 000 ans (Pléistocène)<br></div><div><span style="color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline;"><span class="font" style="font-family:sans-serif"><span class="size" style="font-size:14px">L'activité volcanique s'est étalée sur 250&nbsp;000 ans</span></span></span><br></div><div>Type : surtseyen<br></div><div><br></div>]]></description>
