							<name>Montagne Pelée</name>
							<description><![CDATA[<table class="infobox_v2 noarchive" style="font-size: 12.6px; background: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.2em; clear: right; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em 1em; width: 294px; border: 1px solid rgb(170, 170, 170); border-spacing: 5px; font-family: sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><tbody><tr><th colspan="2" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: center; padding: 4px; background-color: rgb(153, 102, 51); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Géographie<br></th></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altitude" title="Altitude" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Altitude</a><br></th><td>1&nbsp;395&nbsp;<abbr class="abbr" title="mètre" style="border-bottom: 0px; cursor: help; text-decoration: none;">m</abbr><sup id="cite_ref-Géoportail_1-0" class="reference" style="line-height: 1; vertical-align: text-top; position: relative; font-size: 0.8em; top: -2px; padding-left: 1px; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montagne_Pel%C3%A9e#cite_note-G%C3%A9oportail-1" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">1</a></sup><br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cat%C3%A9gorie:Massif_de_montagnes" title="Catégorie:Massif de montagnes" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Massif</a><br></th><td><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Martinique" title="Martinique" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Martinique</a><br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coordonn%C3%A9es_g%C3%A9ographiques" title="Coordonnées géographiques" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Coordonnées</a><br></th><td><a class="mw-kartographer-maplink mw-kartographer-link" href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montagne_Pel%C3%A9e#/maplink/1" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: url(&quot;/w/extensions/Kartographer/styles/images/mapPin-progressive.svg?e68e3&quot;) 0px 0px / contain no-repeat; cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-left: 20px;">14°&nbsp;48′&nbsp;33″&nbsp;nord, 61°&nbsp;09′&nbsp;55″&nbsp;ouest</a><sup id="cite_ref-Géoportail_1-1" class="reference" style="line-height: 1; vertical-align: text-top; position: relative; font-size: 0.8em; top: -2px; padding-left: 1px; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montagne_Pel%C3%A9e#cite_note-G%C3%A9oportail-1" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">1</a></sup><br></td></tr><tr><th colspan="2" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: center; padding: 4px; background-color: rgb(153, 102, 51); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Administration<br></th></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liste_des_pays_du_monde" title="Liste des pays du monde" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Pays</a><br></th><td><span class="datasortkey"><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border noviewer"><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_France.svg?uselang=fr" class="mw-file-description" title="Drapeau de la France" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><img alt="Drapeau de la France" src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Flag_of_France.svg/20px-Flag_of_France.svg.png" width="20" height="13" class="mw-file-element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(234, 236, 240); vertical-align: middle;"></a></span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/France" title="France" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">France</a></span><br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/D%C3%A9partement_et_r%C3%A9gion_d%27outre-mer" title="Département et région d'outre-mer" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Région et département d'outre-mer</a><br></th><td><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Martinique" title="Martinique" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Martinique</a><br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commune_(France)" title="Commune (France)" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Commune</a><br></th><td><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint-Pierre_(Martinique)" title="Saint-Pierre (Martinique)" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Saint-Pierre</a><br></td></tr><tr><th colspan="2" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: center; padding: 4px; background-color: rgb(153, 102, 51); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Géologie<br></th></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;">Âge<br></th><td>300&nbsp;000 ans<sup id="cite_ref-Girault_2-0" class="reference" style="line-height: 1; vertical-align: text-top; position: relative; font-size: 0.8em; top: -2px; padding-left: 1px; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montagne_Pel%C3%A9e#cite_note-Girault-2" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">2</a></sup><br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roche" title="Roche" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Roches</a><br></th><td><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/And%C3%A9site" title="Andésite" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Andésite</a>,<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/And%C3%A9site_basaltique" title="Andésite basaltique" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">andésite basaltique</a>,<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dacite" title="Dacite" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">dacite</a><sup id="cite_ref-Girault_2-1" class="reference" style="line-height: 1; vertical-align: text-top; position: relative; font-size: 0.8em; top: -2px; padding-left: 1px; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montagne_Pel%C3%A9e#cite_note-Girault-2" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">2</a></sup><br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;">Type<br></th><td>Volcan de<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Subduction" title="Subduction" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">subduction</a><br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;">Morphologie<br></th><td><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stratovolcan" title="Stratovolcan" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Stratovolcan</a><br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Activit%C3%A9_d%27un_volcan" title="Activité d'un volcan" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Activité</a><br></th><td>Actif<br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;">Dernière<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89ruption_volcanique" title="Éruption volcanique" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">éruption</a><br></th><td>16 septembre 1929 - fin 1932<br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;">Code<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_Volcanism_Program" title="Global Volcanism Program" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">GVP</a><br></th><td><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://volcano.si.edu/volcano.cfm?vn=360120" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: url(&quot;/w/skins/Vector/resources/skins.vector.styles/images/link-external-small-ltr-progressive.svg?fb64d&quot;) 100% 50% / 0.857em no-repeat; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-right: 1em;">360120</a><br></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" style="vertical-align: super; text-align: left;"><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Observatoire_volcanologique" title="Observatoire volcanologique" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Observatoire</a><br></th><td><a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Observatoire_volcanologique_et_sismologique_de_Martinique" title="Observatoire volcanologique et sismologique de Martinique" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 102, 204); background: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;">Observatoire volcanologique et sismologique de Martinique</a><br></td></tr></tbody></table><div><br></div>]]></description>
